{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485690/extras/0b169a2e5189b04203f6c1b3b864f649.poster.avif?t=1770912990\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485690/extras/0b169a2e5189b04203f6c1b3b864f649.webm?t=1770912990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485690/extras/0b169a2e5189b04203f6c1b3b864f649.mp4?t=1770912990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Raise your very own potion shop in this witchin\u2019 management simulator: Create &amp; design potions, manage their production and sell them to rich wizards, humble guards and other folks in need. <br>Try out new recipes, expand your business and become a tycoon of the potion industry in the Magical Lands!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build and grow your own potion shop<br></li><li> Manage production, prices and staff to build an efficient business<br></li><li> Develop &amp; customize your potion empire: Humble and shabby magic shop or fancy potion mall, the choice is yours!<br></li><li> Adapt to the market by experimenting with tons of ingredients and combinations to create new and improved potions<br></li><li> Dynamic events, VIP requests and competing companies will keep you on your toes<br></li><li>Enjoy the playful 2D hand-drawn style by watching the bustling life in your shop as automated production lines work hard and customers visit your store!</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485690/extras/a4023674dc26b3cac035bb678e2e64a4.poster.avif?t=1770912990\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485690/extras/a4023674dc26b3cac035bb678e2e64a4.webm?t=1770912990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485690/extras/a4023674dc26b3cac035bb678e2e64a4.mp4?t=1770912990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design, Produce &amp; Customize</h2><br>You want to set up a dark and shabby magic shop for the common folks? <br>Then decorate your shop with spooky masks or mummys and produce simple but cheap brews!<br>But if you prefer managing a luxurious and fancy potion mall instead, then selling potent potions in fancy flasks and exquisite interior design will satisfy your expectations.<br><br>Sell potions and customize your shop as YOU like!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Manage, Market &amp; Expand</h2><br>Research new technologies and cultivate specialized staff to unlock new possibilites for your potion production.<br>Streamline your production lines and maximize the efficiency of your potion manufacturing. <br>Use marketing tools to improve the position of your products on the market. <br><br>Expand your business, shake off your rivals on the potion market and become the leading potion seller!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VIP Requests, Faction Fame &amp; Events</h2><br>Alongside the daily potion business, special tasks and chaotic events will demand your attention: <br>VIP customers will request your aid. Help them, gain the their support and achieve fame.<br><br>Build your brand with each potion you make and each decision you take. Increase your brand value and ensure adventurers trust in your potions.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Legendary Potionista","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1485690/d4df4b9b2249d52215056fb5aea735934ce974bb.jpg"},{"name":"The Grandest of Departments","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1485690/5828befcb734a3ac51e66961b2d5627fe76942c2.jpg"},{"name":"Something for Every